{"lyrics":"[00:06.40]Run away (Edsclusive)\n[00:08.16]Run away as fast as you can (Run away as fast as you can)\n[00:18.88]Don't try to stay, you don't stand a chance (Don't stand a chance)\n[00:26.86]And I know it ain't safe, that's why you can't be here with me (Here with me)\n[00:31.98]Why you can't be here with me (Here with me), why you can't be here (Here)\n[00:39.00]Give me one more kiss, try to make it last 'cause it may be our last\n[00:46.38]I'm in love to the fullest, but I don't want you to be here when they collect my soul\n[00:52.34]All the dark ties that I have, I cannot take that shit back\n[00:58.56]I try to numb the pain with a laugh then get a blast from the past\n[01:04.20]Uh, ayy, too much, can't keep up, woah-woah-woah, uh, ayy, overindulgent, yeah-yeah\n[01:11.36]I feel like I'm not enough, woah-woah-woah but you can't have my love for nothing\n[01:15.76]Run away as fast as you can (Run away as fast as you can)\n[01:23.32]Don't try to stay, you don't stand a chance (Don't stand a chance)\n[01:30.40]And I know it ain't safe, that's why you can't be here with me (Here with me)\n[01:36.42]Why you can't be here with me (Here with me), why you can't be here (Here)","words":[[6.4,6.44,"Run"],[6.48,6.94,"away"],[7.12,8.12,"(Edsclusive)"],[8.16,8.42,"Run"],[9.28,9.88,"away"],[9.94,10.06,"as"],[10.18,12.84,"fast"],[12.98,13.28,"as"],[13.36,13.42,"you"],[13.46,13.52,"can"],[14.08,14.28,"(Run"],[14.4,14.86,"away"],[15.74,15.92,"as"],[16.04,16.66,"fast"],[16.74,16.84,"as"],[16.9,17.02,"you"],[17.22,17.72,"can)"],[18.88,19.12,"Don't"],[19.24,19.8,"try"],[20.46,20.58,"to"],[20.8,21.36,"stay,"],[22.14,22.24,"you"],[22.72,22.96,"don't"],[23.04,23.52,"stand"],[23.58,23.58,"a"],[23.7,24.24,"chance"],[24.38,24.46,"(Don't"],[24.5,25.32,"stand"],[25.42,25.42,"a"],[25.68,26.82,"chance)"],[26.86,26.94,"And"],[27.02,27.02,"I"],[27.06,27.16,"know"],[27.28,27.32,"it"],[27.44,27.92,"ain't"],[27.96,28.02,"safe,"],[28.54,28.68,"that's"],[28.76,29.04,"why"],[29.18,29.28,"y